              "content": "Returns the company's bank relationships. A bank relationship with no products at all is silently excluded from the results. For each relationship, `bankProducts` only lists its active products — products marked inactive, or that Embat can no longer match to an account, are silently excluded from that array.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "banks",
                ":companyId"
